cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this software or the method contributed to your work, please cite the method paper below."
title: "RietESD Demo"
abstract: >-
  Corrects estimated standard deviations underestimated by serial correlation in
  Rietveld refinements (Berar & Lelann), with the Durbin-Watson statistic and
  agreement factors. Demonstration version of the RietESD program.
type: software
version: 0.1.1
date-released: "2026-11-15"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/bolevin/rietesd-demo"
authors:
